                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this turn, pick a friendly **^^Cities of Sigmar Human^^** unit that charged this turn and is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target&apos;s melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
