                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Charge^^** ability for a visible unit within 12&quot; of this unit</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend any number of rage dice. If your opponent&apos;s **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7. Then, roll **X** dice, where **X** is the number of rage dice spent. For each 3+, subtract 1 from the charge roll.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
